# Day 8: Lijiang to Kunming to Bangkok

The last day is about as uneventful as the first day. We took a taxi from the
hotel to the Lijiang Railway Station, took the train to Kunming Railway Station,
then took a bus to the Kunming Changshui International Airport. We had a (late)
lunch at the airport and just sat back and relaxed. The airport was pretty small
and there was no lounge so we just sat in front of the gate until the boarding
time. Finally, we got on the plane at around 6PM and arrived in back in Thailand
about 2.5 hours later, ending this trip.

# Post-trip interview

Honestly, the trip wasn't that much fun. Most of the time were spent sitting in
a van and the views outside the window couldn't make up for it. The actual
attractions that we went to were pretty good, though.
